{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/reva-residences-damac-properties-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":300,"crm_id":"2321","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Reva Residences","slug":"reva-residences-damac-properties-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Damac Properties","price":3414600,"display_price":"3.41M","lattitude":25.1878708,"longitude":55.2806658,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Reva Residences is a prestigious residential complex in Dubai, created by one of the most reputable developers - Damac Properties. Located in the Business Bay area by the Dubai Canal, it is just steps away from the city center, where the symbols of Dubai - the famous Burj Khalifa Tower and the huge Dubai Mall - are located.</p><p>The 31-storey building comprises furnished <strong>studios </strong>and <strong>one and two-bedroom apartments,</strong> presenting its residents with modern design and comfort. The residential complex offers a wide range of amenities including a temperature-controlled swimming pool, gym with steam rooms and sauna, children's playground, green park, covered parking, sports field and barbecue area.</p><p>All apartments have well-designed layouts and are delivered with fully equipped kitchens and finishing of high quality materials, which allows residents to decorate their homes to their liking, creating a cozy interior.</p><p>The complex has a convenient location, thanks to the nearby Al Khail Road, which provides easy access to various parts of the city. The popular tourist area of Dubai Marina with its high-rise skyscrapers is only 21 minutes away by car. Reva Residences is in close proximity to various amenities including stores, cafes, schools and a medical center.</p><p>Reva Residences is a unique living space that can be an ideal solution for those who appreciate peace and comfort. The complex allows you to combine the conveniences of city life with the opportunity to enjoy harmony and tranquility.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2321/images/2024/06/26/oPZDYmnIEolEHxNtcNcggvYUh2BPHMCNBy6ylrgF.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/oPZDYmnIEolEHxNtcNcggvYUh2BPHMCNBy6ylrgF.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2321/images/2024/06/26/2ZwrYbwJflUEGXsthNbmZyYzJCsdm4rk22KNrt3K.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/2ZwrYbwJflUEGXsthNbmZyYzJCsdm4rk22KNrt3K.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2321/images/2024/06/26/fkOxzAmnmTNPMJpjhrjw3iBo3SxihoAxhdQNJvi1.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/fkOxzAmnmTNPMJpjhrjw3iBo3SxihoAxhdQNJvi1.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2321/images/2024/06/26/gdS2slXQ9Lsey5UJAfoU4JfO26KpY9MEuI1vMy0C.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/26/gdS2slXQ9Lsey5UJAfoU4JfO26KpY9MEuI1vMy0C.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2370,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_e7526abaf4.pdf","hash":"Brochure_e7526abaf4","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":1608,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1713,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1714,"ur